# Exclude dev / build / audit artefacts from the rsconnect deploy bundle.
# The app itself only needs R/, www/, app.R, methodology.pdf, user_guide.pdf,
# the input template, plus runtime config.

# Dev / build scripts (underscore-prefixed conventions in this project)
_build_aw_response.py
_build_docs.py
_build_methodology.R
_check_sensitivity.R
_check_sensitivity_after.R
_debug_mm_parse.R
_deploy.R
_extract_ipcc.py
_make_comments_tracker.R
_make_feedback_template.R
_smoketest.R
_smoketest_word.R
_verify_catalogue.R
_verify_changes.R
_verify_dist.R
_zim_verify.R
_example_verify.R
_repro_app_path.R
_repro_country_y.R
_verify_x_with_manure.R
_build_help_docs.R

# Help-page cache — keep the rendered HTML in www/docs/ but skip the RDS cache
www/docs/_cache/
deploy_shinyapps.R
install.R

# Source PDFs we audited against (not needed at runtime)
19R_V1_Ch03_Uncertainties.pdf
19R_V4_Ch10_Livestock (2).pdf
19R_V4_Ch11_Soils_N2O_CO2.pdf
V1_3_Ch3_Uncertainties.pdf
V4_10_Ch10_Livestock.pdf
V4_11_Ch11_N2O&CO2.pdf

# Audit text extracts (only used by the dev audit, not the app)
.ipcc_text/

# Historical review-response docs
AW_final_comments_tracker.docx
AW_review_response*.docx
AW_review_response*.md
AW_review_response*.pdf

# Internal meeting notes — not part of the deployed app
docs/meeting_*.md
docs/AW_review_response*.md

# Source-form drafts (the rendered .pdf is what the app serves)
methodology.Rmd
user_guide.Rmd
user_guide_draft.md
www/user_guide_draft.md
methodology.log

# Beta feedback / templates not used at runtime
beta_feedback_template.csv
beta_feedback_template.xlsx

# Stale country-specific upload (raw country data file)
22-07-2023*.xlsx

# Python build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Workspace / editor files
*.code-workspace
.vscode/

# Backup file from the May 2026 audit
*.pre_audit_2026_05_bak

# 2026-06: in-app AI translator runtime artefacts. The usage log and any
# auth tokens are created at runtime in the deployed container's working
# dir; never bundle a local dev copy into the deploy.
translator_usage_log.csv
auth_tokens.csv
.env

# NOTE on .Renviron: shinyapps.io does NOT support the rsconnect envVars
# argument, so secrets are shipped via a `.Renviron` file in the app root.
# That file IS bundled into the deploy (it must be, for the deployed R
# session to read it), but is gitignored so it never enters git history.
# Keep .Renviron OUT of this .rscignore.
